{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p> <br/>2025 年 12 月 3 日，華盛頓國會山，英偉達總裁兼行政總裁黃仁勳抵達參議院銀行委員會會場並接受媒體採訪。</p>\n<p>這場聽證會大概率要求宣誓作證、全程記錄文字筆錄，多個委員會都會參與。</p>\n<p>馬斯特表示，他已經告知黃仁勳，如果有必要，他會對黃仁勳發出傳票強制傳喚。</p>\n<p>馬斯特還稱，國會不排除後續針對其他相關人員或事項召開公開聽證會。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:04:19.433072+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:51:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:47.116348+00:00","content_hash":"fc9a36b2de454b09f9f40ed8def262800a016aeeb980c89e36f620329e9f2e9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:04:19.433072+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}